Suppose we have three users :-
Arun
John
David

Instead of creating three different components, create one reusable UserCard.

Look at this :-
<UserCard
  name="Arun"
  role="React Developer"
  location="Sydney"
/>

The data goes into the component as "Props".

Inside :-
function UserCard(props) { ... }

we receive those props.

Then :-
props.name
props.role
props.location

give us the values.

So :-
App
 ↓
UserCard
 ↓
props
 ↓
name
role
location
 ↓
UI
